// A bounded `sort | head 4` is a prefix of the full sort (batch size 20).
// With the optimization barrier; both share one baseline.
// This family runs at three batch sizes: the bound falls inside a batch,
// so it is where batching can change the result.
load_stdin
read_json _batch_size=20
sort key?
optimize_barrier
head 4
write_json compact=true
